/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Markets\040for\040Technology\040and\040their\040Implications\040for\040Corporate\040Strategy)
/Author (Ashish\040Arora\054\040Andrea\040Fosfuri\054\040Alfonso\040Gambardella)
/Subject (Although\040market\040transactions\040for\040technologies\054\040ideas\054\040knowledge\040or\040information\040are\040limited\040by\040several\040well\055known\040imperfections\054\040there\040is\040evidence\040that\040they\040have\040become\040more\040common\040than\040in\040the\040past\056\040In\040this\040paper\040we\040analyze\040how\040the\040presence\040of\040markets\040for\040technology\040conditions\040the\040technology\040and\040corporate\040strategy\040of\040firms\056\040The\040first\040and\040most\040obvious\040implication\040is\040that\040markets\040for\040technology\040increase\040the\040strategy\040space\072\040firms\040can\040choose\040to\040license\040in\040the\040technology\040instead\040of\040developing\040it\040in\055house\040or\040they\040can\040choose\040to\040license\040out\040their\040technology\040instead\040of\040\050or\040in\040addition\040to\051\040investing\040in\040the\040downstream\040assets\040needed\040to\040manufacture\040and\040commercialize\040the\040goods\056\040The\040implications\040for\040management\040include\040more\040proactive\040management\040of\040intellectual\040property\054\040greater\040attention\040to\040external\040monitoring\040of\040technologies\054\040and\040organizational\040changes\040to\040support\040technology\040licensing\054\040joint\055ventures\040and\040acquisition\040of\040external\040technology\056\040For\040entrepreneurial\040startups\054\040markets\040for\040technology\040make\040a\040focused\040business\040model\040more\040attractive\056\040At\040the\040industry\040level\054\040markets\040for\040technology\040may\040lower\040barriers\040to\040entry\040and\040increase\040competition\054\040with\040important\040implications\040for\040the\040firms\047\040broader\040strategy\040as\040well\056\040Copyright\0402001\040by\040Oxford\040University\040Press\056)
